meta {
  name: Get Stock Ledger
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/stock/ledger?page=1&per_page=20&product_id=&transaction_type=&date_from=&date_to=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  per_page: 20
  ~product_id: 
  ~transaction_type: 
  ~date_from: 
  ~date_to: 
}

docs {
  Fetch moving-average stock ledger entries and running balances per product.
  
  Permission required: `ledger.read`
  
  Query Parameters:
  - `page` (optional, default: 1): Page number for pagination
  - `per_page` / `limit` (optional, default: 20, max: 100): Number of records per page
  - `product_id` (optional, UUID): Filter by product ID
  - `transaction_type` (optional, enum: GR, GI, OPNAME, TRANSFER, SO, POS): Filter by movement transaction type
  - `date_from` (optional, string: YYYY-MM-DD): Filter entries created on or after date
  - `date_to` (optional, string: YYYY-MM-DD): Filter entries created on or before date
  
  Response Data Schema:
  - `id`: Stock ledger UUID
  - `product_id`: Product UUID
  - `transaction_id`: Source reference number or transaction code (e.g. GR-2026-0001, SO-2026-0001, OPNAME-2026-0001)
  - `transaction_type`: Transaction classification code (GR, GI, OPNAME, TRANSFER, SO, POS)
  - `transaction_type_label`: Human-readable label (e.g. Goods Receipt, Sales Order)
  - `qty`: Signed movement quantity (positive for in, negative for out)
  - `unit_cost`: Unit cost price of movement
  - `average_cost`: Moving average cost after movement
  - `stock_value`: Total stock value after movement (running_qty * average_cost)
  - `running_qty`: Product stock running balance after movement
  - `created_at`: Movement timestamp
}
